          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and after they have been destroyed before you, be careful not to be ensnared by inquiring about their gods, saying, \"How do these nations serve their gods? We will do the same.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "You must not worship the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "DEU.12.31",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "DEU.12.31"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "your God in their way, because in worshiping their gods, they do all kinds of detestable things the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
